{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32029","headline":"处州李使君改任遂州因寄赠 · 贾岛","name":"处州李使君改任遂州因寄赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭树几株阴入户，主人何在客闻蝉。\n钥开原上高楼锁，瓶汲池东古井泉。\n趂静野禽曾後到，休吟邻叟始安眠。\n仙都山水谁能忆，西去风涛书满船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}